{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:53 2026-08-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:53 2026-08-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:53 2026-08-04 HKT</p><p>旺角花園街100號地下一間麻雀館，今（4日）近11時，29歲麻雀館男職員在香薰機加香薰油期間，疑因搶火燒傷面部，其他職員見狀報警求助。消防接報到場，6分鐘將火救熄，救護員為事主臉部敷上降溫面膜，他清醒獲送廣華醫院治理。</p><img alt=\"消防接報到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/60f83905c74effd4b731a9a845864e2f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_11_32_34_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b2fede24833fdecc311e7f0f7c0c5f23/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_11_32_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/86b26af668a47fc9a6db621dd4c9bb1c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_11_32_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批消防到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9bf709d4517c791b5710f7519581140/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_11_32_32.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ded1fc4fd536c1f53d5d4482a164794d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_11_32_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事主臉部燒傷。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d23312fcba6bae88fb18ed9f9948d7ef/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_11_32_30_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事主臉部燒傷。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e0a76a1f7c83fc54887667038a038e98/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-04_at_11_32_28.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T04:01:19.061571+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}